#: core/templates/core/home.html:115
msgid ""
"My name is Bismark Reyes Arias, a 24-year-old independent audiovisual artist "
"born in Cuba. I started at 15. Since the beginning, I was interested in "
"video editing using After Effects. Over the years, I became a professional "
"in this software. Currently, I master not only After Effects but also "
"Premiere Pro, DaVinci Resolve, Photoshop, Maya, Blender, and Cinema 4D."
msgstr ""
"Mi nombre es Bismark Reyes Arias, soy un joven de 24 años nacido en Cuba y "
"artista audiovisual independiente desde los 15 años. Desde mis inicios me "
"interesé en la edición de videos mediante el software After Effects, con los "
"años me volví profesional dentro de este programa, actualmente no solo "
"domino After Effects sino también: Premiere Pro, Davinci Resolve, Photoshop, "
"Maya, Blender y Cinema 4D."

#: core/templates/core/home.html:118
msgid ""
"My independent work includes: Thumbnails, Banners, and avatars for YouTube "
"channels, Flyers, business cards and promotional cards for businesses, Video "
"Blogs for national YouTubers, Promotional Videos for national stores, "
"Official Music Videos for independent artists, TV program intros, and "
"Official Lyric Videos."
msgstr ""
"Dentro de los trabajos independientes que he realizado se encuentra: "
"Miniaturas, Banners y avatares para canales de Youtube, Flyers, tarjetas de "
"presentación y tarjetas promocionales para negocios, Videos Blogs para "
"youtubers Nacionales, Videos Promocionales para tiendas nacionales, Videos "
"Clips oficiales oara artistas musicales independientes, Introducciones para "
"programas televisivos y Videos Lyrics oficiales."

